cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "F1Tenth.jl"
abstract: >-
  F1Tenth.jl is an F1TENTH simulator in Julia. It is a port of the Python
  f1tenth_gym, and it keeps the API of the Python code. It simulates one real
  F1TENTH car, ForzaETH's NUC5, from published values: Magic Formula tires
  with a friction ellipse, the low-level actuator chain of the car (command
  limiter, steering servo and VESC speed loop), and its Hokuyo UST-10LX LiDAR
  as its specification describes it.
